function basis(o,X,Y){var Z=[X[1]*Y[2]-X[2]*Y[1],X[2]*Y[0]-X[0]*Y[2],X[0]*Y[1]-X[1]*Y[0]];return new Float32Array([X[0],X[1],X[2],0,Y[0],Y[1],Y[2],0,Z[0],Z[1],Z[2],0,o[0],o[1],o[2],1]);}
